      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip sandwich cookies into the melted candy melts - feel free to coat only half of the cookie, or coat all sides. Place red cookies on a plate lined with wax paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Decorate with assorted sprinkles. Allow to harden before removing to serve.",
